  message: "FIRST TRANCHE in PR #2329: docs/audits/0028-deleted-route-rows-triage.md, the 28 deleted rows whose concept is route. Measured, one fixture per framework (15) and a real repository where one is local. The 28 rows are 61 forms: 20 DETECTED by another row, analyzer or linker, 10 PARTLY, 21 NOT DETECTED, 10 NOT A ROUTE (grouping calls, hooks, an in-process GraphQL call). Every form of aiohttp, akka-http, ktor and slim is undetected; some output is wrong rather than missing (fastify .route({url}) recorded as GET /, gorilla .Methods recorded ANY on 14 of 14 routes of microservices-demo, Solid client-side routes labelled HTTP GET).\nCORRECTION TO THIS ITEM'S TEXT: \"Express and koa routes do come from usage rows\" is wrong for koa. Named-handler koa routes come from js_ts markers; inline-handler koa routes are not detected at all (koa.yaml has no route usage row).\nNO DETECTOR WAS BUILT. THE ITEM STAYS OPEN: 136 rows untriaged (middleware 61, command 28, error_handler 10, websocket_handler 8, task 6, entrypoint 6, controller 5, graphql_schema 5, ipc_handler 2, liveview 2, scheduled_task 1, event_handler 1, graphql_resolver 1). Per-construct items for the undetected route forms are filed separately.\nFixtures and scripts: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/three_pr_plan_11222026/pr2/movur_fixtures/.\n\nFILED FROM THIS TRANCHE: WI-mopuj (three route forms recorded wrongly), WI-dopuh (route forms nothing detects)."  # 5dee
